    "Vid-V6-dzq.title" : [
      {
        "target" : "Тільки під час наступної синхронізації календарі на цьому iPhone буде замінено календарями з цього Mac.",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Kalendáře v tomto iPhonu budou nahrazeny kalendáři z Macu (vztahuje se jen na příští synchronizaci).",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "केवल अगले सिंक के दौरान इस iPhone पर मौजूद कैलेंडर इस Mac के कैलेंडर से  बदल दिए जाएँगे।",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "During the next sync only, the calendars on this iPhone will be replaced with calendars from this Mac.",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Koledarji v tem iPhonu bodo s koledarji iz tega Maca zamenjani samo med naslednjo sinhronizacijo.",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "sl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Erst bei der nächsten Synchronisierung werden die Kalender auf diesem iPhone durch die auf diesem  Mac befindlichen Kalender ersetzt.",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apenas na próxima sincronização, os calendários neste iPhone serão substituídos pelos calendários deste Mac.",
        "filename" : "DeviceSettingsAdvanced.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "During the next sync only, the calendars on this iPhone will be replaced with calendars from this Mac.",
